ormation\n\nWindows 10\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen string formatting integer minimum value (`-9223372036854775808`) using integer format specifiers (`%d`, `%x`, `%X`, `%o`) the result contains two minus signs.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nScript:\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends EditorScript\n\nfunc _run() -> void:\n\ttest((1 << 63))\n\ttest((1 << 63) - 1)\n\ttest((1 << 63) + 1)\n\nfunc test(n: int) -> void:\n\tprint()\n\tprint(n)\n\tprint(str(n))\n\tprint(\"%s\" % n)\n\tprint(\"%d\" % n)\n\tprint(\"%x\" % n)\n\tprint(\"%X\" % n)\n\tprint(\"%o\" % n)\n```\nOutput:\n```\n-9223372036854775808\n-9223372036854775808\n-9223372036854775808\n--9223372036854775808      <--------------------------\n--8000000000000000         <--------------------------\n--8000000000000000         <--------------------------\n--1000000000000000000000   <--------------------------\n\n9223372036854775807\n9223372036854775807\n9223372036854775807\n9223372036854775807\n7fffffffffffffff\n7FFFFFFFFFFFFFFF\n777777777777777777777\n\n-9223372036854775807\n-9223372036854775807\n-9223372036854775807\n-9223372036854775807\n-7fffffffffffffff\n-7FFFFFFFFFFFFFFF\n-777777777777777777777\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/ev